### Description

When a `hosted_vllm` backend rejects a request with a well-formed OpenAI error object, the proxy does not relay its fields. The client receives:

- `error.param: null`, although the backend named the parameter (`"param": "max_tokens"`);
- `error.message` set to `litellm.BadRequestError: Hosted_vllmException - ` followed by the backend's whole error body as a JSON string, followed by `\n\nLiteLLM: model group '...' failed with the error above. No fallback was attempted.`;
- on `/
